---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terminology"
  description="The DPP vocabulary as a multilingual Glossarist dataset: 82 EN definitions from the converted corpus, plus 30 from CWA 18291 and 29 from IDTA 01001 — 141 harvested entries, 145 verified concepts — the source of the proposed ISO 25534-1 Part 1."
  eyebrow="Reference — terminology"
>
  <h1>Terminology</h1>
  <p class="lede">
    A multilingual Glossarist concept-browser edition of the Digital Product Passport
    vocabulary, compiled from the published European Standards, CEN Workshop Agreements,
    and ISO working drafts — including the recorded definitional conflict between ISO/AWI
    25534-1 and EN 18223:2026, presented for harmonization under the proposed ISO 25534-1
    Part 1 (Vocabulary).
  </p>

  <section id="dataset" aria-labelledby="dataset-h">
    <h2 id="dataset-h">The dataset</h2>
    <p>The dataset is a Glossarist v3 concept collection:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>141 harvested term definitions</strong> — 82 from the EN series, 30 from
        CWA 18291, and 29 from IDTA 01001, resolved into <strong>145 verified concepts</strong>
        against a single registered scheme.
      </li>
      <li>
        English is authoritative; French and German localizations are carried where the
        source documents provide trilingual titles, with extensions later.
      </li>
      <li>
        Localized concepts carry authoritative-source citations per term; the recorded
        definitional conflict is presented as data for harmonization, not silently
        resolved.
      </li>
      <li>
        The section tree follows the harmonization annex structure: identity, actors,
        lifecycle, trust, semantics, carriers, profiles, events, measurement.
      </li>
      <li>
        Framework terms — profile, lens, Tier-A payload, edge segment, passive and active
        twin, blind edge, provenance class, precedence rule, among others — enter the
        dataset through the same registered workflow as they stabilize.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      The dataset is the single source of truth for the vocabulary draft of NWIP-1 (ISO
      25534-1 Part 1): the draft is generated from the dataset, not the reverse. See the
      <a href="/papers/">papers catalogue</a> for the terminology announcement
      contribution.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="browser" class="plate" aria-labelledby="browser-h">
    <h2 id="browser-h">Concept browser</h2>
    <!--
      Glossarist browser embed point. When the dataset is deployed, replace the
      placeholder below with the iframe:
      <iframe
        src="https://glossarist.org/unidpp/"
        title="UniDPP DPP vocabulary concept browser"
        style="width:100%;min-height:640px;border:1px solid #e3e7ec;border-radius:6px"
        loading="lazy"
      ></iframe>
    -->
    <div class="embed">
      <p class="embed-title">Concept browser embed</p>
      <p>
        The Glossarist browser for the UniDPP vocabulary dataset will be embedded here once
        the dataset is deployed to glossarist.org. The embed point and iframe markup are
        prepared in the page source.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
